OL,3,CChannel Island cricket bodies unveil
OL,4,Cambitious plan to grow the game
OL,6,FThe cricket season may almost be at an
OL,7,Fend, but the hard work never stops for
OL,8,Fthose running the game.
OL,10,FJersey and Guernsey Cricket are among
OL,11,Fthe smallest of the 111 International
OL,12,FCricket Council (ICC) members, but
OL,13,Fwant to bowl ahead with their plans
OL,14,Ffor the future.
OL,16,FJersey want to build on a golden
OL,17,Fgeneration, which has seen Asa Tribe
OL,18,Fplaying for the England Lions and
OL,19,Fhelping the island side to a place in
OL,20,Fthe World's Top 30 in T20 cricket.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/6
