PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1790353094
OL,3,CChannel Island cricket bodies unveil
OL,4,Cambitious plan to grow the game
OL,6,FGuernsey are just seven places below
OL,7,Fin 36th, and are on the same page as
OL,8,FJersey in wanting to supercharge the
OL,9,Fgame in the islands by focusing on a
OL,10,Fspecific sector: Junior Cricket.
OL,12,FJohn Harris, Jersey Cricket Chair
OL,14,FJersey's three-year strategy builds
OL,15,Fupon its previous three-year strategy
OL,16,Fto elevate both the men's and the
OL,17,Fwomen's games
OL,19,FHowever, with ambitious plans comes
OL,20,Fthe need for funding from central
OL,21,Fgovernment, sponsorship, and the ICC.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
