OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1790353094
OL,3,CChannel Island cricket bodies unveil
OL,4,Cambitious plan to grow the game
OL,6,FJohn explains why that financial
OL,7,Fsupport is "unequivocally" needed to
OL,8,Fgrow the game.
OL,10,FNeil MacRae - Jersey Director of
OL,11,FCricket
OL,13,FIt helps to have role models to show
OL,14,Fjust how far someone can go. Asa Tribe
OL,15,Fmade his break into international
OL,16,Fcricket playing for Jersey in 2021.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
