OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1790353094
OL,3,CChannel Island cricket bodies unveil
OL,4,Cambitious plan to grow the game
OL,6,FNow 22-years-old, he's a firm
OL,7,Ffavourite in the England Lions,
OL,8,Fscoring a century against Australia A
OL,9,Fduring the Lions' tour of Australia
OL,10,Flast year.
OL,12,FIt is all about fostering excitement
OL,13,Ffor youngsters and cultivating a long-
OL,14,Fterm passion, something which Neil is
OL,15,Fkeen to continue over the next three
OL,16,Fyears...
OL,18,FSarah Gommersall, Jersey Cricket CEO
OL,20,FThe wheels of change can at times turn
OL,21,Fpainfully slowly in cricket.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
