OL,3,CChannel Island cricket bodies unveil
OL,4,Cambitious plan to grow the game
OL,6,FIf anyone is going to be heard above
OL,7,Fthe din in a sport dominated by men
OL,8,Fand living in an island far smaller
OL,9,Fthan most ICC members, it's Jersey's
OL,10,FCEO Sarah Gommersall.
OL,12,FSarah explains why, by standing for
OL,13,Felection to the ICC's Chief Executives
OL,14,FCommittee, she hopes to get Jersey's
OL,15,Fvoice heard by the top heads of the
OL,16,Fsport.
OL,18,FRichard Headington, Chief Operating
OL,19,FOfficer of Guernsey Cricket
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
