CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1790353094
OL,3,CChannel Island cricket bodies unveil
OL,4,Cambitious plan to grow the game
OL,6,FGuernsey Cricket is walking hand-in-
OL,7,Fhand with Jersey Cricket, releasing
OL,8,Ftheir blueprint for future success
OL,9,Fthat focuses on growing their
OL,10,Fgrassroots programmes.
OL,12,FThe island hopes that by concentrating
OL,13,Fits resources in the younger
OL,14,Fgeneration, it can keep them in the
OL,15,Fgame for the long term.
OL,17,FRichard Headington hopes to encourage
OL,18,Fthis via clubs in the island.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/6
